  "units": [
    {
      "unit_id": "u0001",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 1,
      "source_text": "# Chron-LLM R0 Runtime\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0002",
      "line_start": 3,
      "line_end": 3,
      "source_text": "## Llama Backend Interface Specification v1.0\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0003",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5,
      "source_text": "**Status**\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0004",
      "line_start": 7,
      "line_end": 8,
      "source_text": "* Stable\n* R0 Reference Runtime\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0005",
      "line_start": 10,
      "line_end": 10,
      "source_text": "**Layer**\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0006",
      "line_start": 12,
      "line_end": 13,
      "source_text": "* Backend Adapter\n* Physical Runtime Interface\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0007",
      "line_start": 15,
      "line_end": 15,
      "source_text": "**Scope**\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0008",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 23,
      "source_text": "```\nPrompt\n    ↓\nllama.cpp CLI\n    ↓\nRaw Text\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0009",
      "line_start": 27,
      "line_end": 27,
      "source_text": "# 1. 目的\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0010",
      "line_start": 29,
      "line_end": 29,
      "source_text": "本モジュールは、Chron-R0 RuntimeからLLMを利用するための最小バックエンドである。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0011",
      "line_start": 31,
      "line_end": 31,
      "source_text": "R0では\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0012",
      "line_start": 33,
      "line_end": 41,
      "source_text": "```\nHistory\n    ↓\nPrompt Projection\n    ↓\nBackend\n    ↓\nGenerated Text\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0013",
      "line_start": 43,
      "line_end": 43,
      "source_text": "のみを担当し、\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0014",
      "line_start": 45,
      "line_end": 48,
      "source_text": "* Validation\n* Candidate\n* Kernel\n* World\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0015",
      "line_start": 50,
      "line_end": 50,
      "source_text": "などは一切扱わない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0016",
      "line_start": 54,
      "line_end": 54,
      "source_text": "# 2. パッケージ\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0017",
      "line_start": 56,
      "line_end": 58,
      "source_text": "```\nchronos-r0.llama\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0018",
      "line_start": 60,
      "line_end": 60,
      "source_text": "Export\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0019",
      "line_start": 62,
      "line_end": 64,
      "source_text": "```\nllama-run\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0020",
      "line_start": 66,
      "line_end": 66,
      "source_text": "公開APIはこの1関数のみである。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0021",
      "line_start": 70,
      "line_end": 70,
      "source_text": "# 3. アーキテクチャ\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0022",
      "line_start": 72,
      "line_end": 94,
      "source_text": "```\nHistory\n\n↓\n\nPrompt\n\n↓\n\nllama-run()\n\n↓\n\nllama.cpp\n\n↓\n\nstdout\n\n↓\n\nString\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0023",
      "line_start": 96,
      "line_end": 96,
      "source_text": "CLIをBackendとして利用する非常に単純なAdapterとなる。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0024",
      "line_start": 100,
      "line_end": 100,
      "source_text": "# 4. Public API\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0025",
      "line_start": 102,
      "line_end": 104,
      "source_text": "```\n(llama-run prompt)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0026",
      "line_start": 106,
      "line_end": 106,
      "source_text": "## 引数\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0027",
      "line_start": 108,
      "line_end": 110,
      "source_text": "```\nprompt\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0028",
      "line_start": 112,
      "line_end": 112,
      "source_text": "型\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0029",
      "line_start": 114,
      "line_end": 116,
      "source_text": "```\nstring\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0030",
      "line_start": 118,
      "line_end": 118,
      "source_text": "Prompt Projection層が生成した完全なプロンプト。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0031",
      "line_start": 122,
      "line_end": 122,
      "source_text": "## 戻り値\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0032",
      "line_start": 124,
      "line_end": 126,
      "source_text": "```\nstring\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0033",
      "line_start": 128,
      "line_end": 128,
      "source_text": "llama.cpp が標準出力へ生成した全文。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0034",
      "line_start": 130,
      "line_end": 130,
      "source_text": "整形は行わない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0035",
      "line_start": 134,
      "line_end": 134,
      "source_text": "# 5. 実装方式\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0036",
      "line_start": 136,
      "line_end": 136,
      "source_text": "LLM実行には\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0037",
      "line_start": 138,
      "line_end": 140,
      "source_text": "```\nuiop:run-program\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0038",
      "line_start": 142,
      "line_end": 142,
      "source_text": "を使用する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0039",
      "line_start": 144,
      "line_end": 146,
      "source_text": "```\n(uiop:run-program ...)\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0040",
      "line_start": 148,
      "line_end": 148,
      "source_text": "同期実行であり、\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0041",
      "line_start": 150,
      "line_end": 150,
      "source_text": "呼び出し側は終了まで待機する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0042",
      "line_start": 154,
      "line_end": 154,
      "source_text": "# 6. llama.cpp 実行構成\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0043",
      "line_start": 156,
      "line_end": 156,
      "source_text": "実行ファイル\n"
    },
    {
