    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0049",
      "line_start": 174,
      "line_end": 174,
      "source_text": "単一ターン生成。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0050",
      "line_start": 178,
      "line_end": 180,
      "source_text": "```\n--n-predict 128\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0051",
      "line_start": 182,
      "line_end": 182,
      "source_text": "最大生成トークン数\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0052",
      "line_start": 184,
      "line_end": 186,
      "source_text": "```\n128\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0053",
      "line_start": 190,
      "line_end": 192,
      "source_text": "```\n--system-prompt\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0054",
      "line_start": 194,
      "line_end": 194,
      "source_text": "固定System Prompt\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0055",
      "line_start": 196,
      "line_end": 198,
      "source_text": "```\nあなたは日本語で丁寧で簡潔に答えるアシスタントです。\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0056",
      "line_start": 202,
      "line_end": 204,
      "source_text": "```\n-p prompt\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0057",
      "line_start": 206,
      "line_end": 206,
      "source_text": "Prompt Projection層が生成した全文を入力する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0058",
      "line_start": 210,
      "line_end": 210,
      "source_text": "# 7. 実行フロー\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0059",
      "line_start": 212,
      "line_end": 229,
      "source_text": "```\nPrompt\n      │\n      ▼\nllama-run\n      │\n      ▼\nrun-program\n      │\n      ▼\nllama-completion\n      │\n      ▼\nstdout\n      │\n      ▼\nCommon Lisp String\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0060",
      "line_start": 233,
      "line_end": 233,
      "source_text": "# 8. エラー処理\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0061",
      "line_start": 235,
      "line_end": 237,
      "source_text": "```\n:error-output :string\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0062",
      "line_start": 239,
      "line_end": 239,
      "source_text": "stderrは取得される。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0063",
      "line_start": 243,
      "line_end": 245,
      "source_text": "```\n:ignore-error-status t\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0064",
      "line_start": 247,
      "line_end": 247,
      "source_text": "プロセス終了コードによる例外は送出しない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0065",
      "line_start": 249,
      "line_end": 249,
      "source_text": "つまり\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0066",
      "line_start": 251,
      "line_end": 253,
      "source_text": "```\nBackend Failure\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0067",
      "line_start": 255,
      "line_end": 255,
      "source_text": "であっても\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0068",
      "line_start": 257,
      "line_end": 257,
      "source_text": "Lisp Runtimeは停止しない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0069",
      "line_start": 259,
      "line_end": 259,
      "source_text": "上位層が必要に応じて内容を解析する設計となっている。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0070",
      "line_start": 263,
      "line_end": 263,
      "source_text": "# 9. 設計原則\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0071",
      "line_start": 265,
      "line_end": 265,
      "source_text": "## Backend Isolation\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0072",
      "line_start": 267,
      "line_end": 267,
      "source_text": "LLM固有仕様は本モジュールに閉じ込める。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0073",
      "line_start": 269,
      "line_end": 269,
      "source_text": "R0 Runtimeは\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0074",
      "line_start": 271,
      "line_end": 273,
      "source_text": "```\nString → String\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0075",
      "line_start": 275,
      "line_end": 275,
      "source_text": "という抽象インターフェースのみ利用する。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0076",
      "line_start": 279,
      "line_end": 279,
      "source_text": "## Stateless\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0077",
      "line_start": 281,
      "line_end": 281,
      "source_text": "状態を保持しない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0078",
      "line_start": 283,
      "line_end": 283,
      "source_text": "保持するもの\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0079",
      "line_start": 285,
      "line_end": 285,
      "source_text": "なし\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0080",
      "line_start": 287,
      "line_end": 287,
      "source_text": "保持しないもの\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0081",
      "line_start": 289,
      "line_end": 293,
      "source_text": "* Session\n* History\n* Candidate\n* Kernel State\n* KV Cache\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0082",
      "line_start": 297,
      "line_end": 297,
      "source_text": "## Synchronous Execution\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0083",
      "line_start": 299,
      "line_end": 301,
      "source_text": "```\nPrompt\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0084",
      "line_start": 303,
      "line_end": 303,
      "source_text": "↓\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0085",
      "line_start": 305,
      "line_end": 307,
      "source_text": "```\nBlocking Execution\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0086",
      "line_start": 309,
      "line_end": 309,
      "source_text": "↓\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0087",
      "line_start": 311,
      "line_end": 313,
      "source_text": "```\nGenerated Text\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0088",
      "line_start": 315,
      "line_end": 315,
      "source_text": "逐次生成は扱わない。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0089",
      "line_start": 319,
      "line_end": 319,
      "source_text": "# 10. R0での責務\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0090",
      "line_start": 321,
      "line_end": 321,
      "source_text": "担当\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0091",
      "line_start": 323,
      "line_end": 329,
      "source_text": "* Prompt送信\n* CLI起動\n* モデル指定\n* System Prompt指定\n* 生成結果取得\n* stderr取得\n\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0092",
      "line_start": 330,
      "line_end": 330,
      "source_text": "担当外\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0093",
      "line_start": 332,
      "line_end": 343,
      "source_text": "* Prompt生成\n* History管理\n* Token Streaming\n* Validation\n* Retry\n* Temperature制御\n* Candidate生成\n* Commit\n* World管理\n* Memory管理\n* Graph管理\n\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0094",
      "line_start": 346,
      "line_end": 346,
      "source_text": "# 11. データフロー\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0095",
      "line_start": 348,
      "line_end": 368,
      "source_text": "```\nHistory\n      │\n      ▼\nPrompt Projection\n      │\n      ▼\nPrompt String\n      │\n      ▼\nllama-run\n      │\n      ▼\nllama.cpp CLI\n      │\n      ▼\nRaw Text\n      │\n      ▼\nR0 Runtime\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0096",
      "line_start": 372,
      "line_end": 372,
      "source_text": "# 12. アーキテクチャ上の位置\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0097",
      "line_start": 374,
      "line_end": 399,
      "source_text": "```\n┌────────────────────┐\n│ History            │\n└─────────┬──────────┘\n          │\n          ▼\n┌────────────────────┐\n│ Prompt Projection  │\n└─────────┬──────────┘\n          │\n          ▼\n┌────────────────────┐\n│ llama-run          │\n│ Backend Adapter    │\n└─────────┬──────────┘\n          │\n          ▼\n┌────────────────────┐\n│ llama.cpp CLI      │\n└─────────┬──────────┘\n          │\n          ▼\n┌────────────────────┐\n│ Generated Text     │\n└────────────────────┘\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0098",
      "line_start": 403,
      "line_end": 403,
      "source_text": "# 13. 将来拡張\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0099",
      "line_start": 405,
      "line_end": 405,
      "source_text": "本APIはバックエンド非依存のインターフェースとして設計されており、`llama.cpp` 固有の実装を他の推論エンジンへ置き換えることが可能である。\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0100",
      "line_start": 407,
      "line_end": 407,
      "source_text": "置き換え候補例:\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0101",
      "line_start": 409,
      "line_end": 414,
      "source_text": "* llama.cpp Server\n* llama.cpp C API\n* Ollama\n* vLLM\n* OpenAI Compatible API\n* LM Studio API\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0102",
      "line_start": 416,
      "line_end": 416,
      "source_text": "これらはすべて `llama-run(prompt) -> string` の契約を維持する限り、R0 Runtimeの他のモジュールを変更せずに差し替えられる。\n"
    }
  ]
}
